                    %mi i
                  %mo →
                  %mi X
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} }
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \{U_i \to X\}
            by a collection of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+forms"} differential forms
            and functions
