            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              Instead of the site
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CartSp"} CartSp
              of def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#Smooth0Types"}
              one could use the site
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SmoothMfd"} SmoothMfd
              of all smooth manifolds. All of the statements and constructions in the following go through in that case just as well. In fact
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CartSp"} CartSp
              is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dense+subsite"} dense subsite
              of
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SmoothMfd"} SmoothMfd
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/abelian+sheaf+cohomology"} abelian sheaf cohomology
              is the same for both sites, but on the other hand means that it is convenient to restrict to the much “smaller” site of Cartesian spaces. In fact since the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stalks"} stalks
              of sheaves over smooth manifolds are evaluations on small
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/open+balls"} open balls
              and since every open ball is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diffeomorphism"} diffeomorphic
              to a Cartesian space, many statements that are true (only) stalkwise over
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SmoothMfd"} SmoothMfd
              are actually true globally over
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi CartSp
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} CartSp
              = succeed "\u201D" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/descent"} descent
              = succeed "\u201D" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinity-stackification"} infinity-stackification
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CartSp"} CartSp
