              is concentrated in a single degree, in which case the first term in the sum defining the differential in def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CechComplex"}
              disappears. When
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi A
                      %mo •
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A_\bullet
              is not concentrated in a single degree, then for emphasis one sometimes speaks of
              = succeed "." do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hypercohomology"} hypercohomology
          .num_remark
