          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_12 Remark
            %p
              The form of the exact hexagon characterizing the Deligne complex via prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TheDifferentialHexagonForDeligne"}
              is in fact a general abstract consequence of the fact that all universal constructions in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
